# Pairs with BackupSagaConsistent. REPRODUCES PRODUCTION BEFORE THE #4589 FIX:
# IncrementalDeltaCollector copied every prepared write in the delta window as
# an ordinary entry and dropped the TxCommit / TxAbort terminals, so nothing was
# resolved against a decision and nothing was held back. An increment taken
# while a saga is half prepared holds one of its keys post-saga.
MODULE: BackupSagaConsistentIncrementCopiesPrepares
TARGET: BackupSagaConsistent
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: prepared writes are copied as data and terminals dropped (#4589)
PERTURBS: Drain

--- FIND
         IF FallsBack
         THEN FullLink(Lens, TRUE)
         ELSE [kind |-> "incr", heads |-> NewHeads, emit |-> Emit,
--- REPLACE
         \* MUTATION: every prepare in the window is copied; no decision, no hold.
         IF FALSE
         THEN FullLink(Lens, TRUE)
         ELSE [kind |-> "incr", heads |-> Lens, emit |-> SeenPrep,
--- END
